# Cloudflare Pages response headers. No other site may show MoonSafe inside a frame (clickjacking on wallet signing).
# A full Content-Security-Policy is NOT set yet: Privy, WalletConnect and the RPCs need a long allowlist, so try it in Report-Only first
# (docs/audit-mainnet-2026-10-29.md).
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), payment=()
